WEBVTT

00:01.350 --> 00:03.470
Our second decisive battle
with the villains...

00:04.460 --> 00:06.590
At the Gunga Villa site,

00:06.590 --> 00:10.590
the struggle to the death between the
heroes and All For One continues.

00:11.690 --> 00:13.480
You're shaking.

00:13.850 --> 00:15.850
Poor thing.

00:18.190 --> 00:24.550
You came here thinking this was an
extension of school, didn't you?

00:37.430 --> 00:42.470
It was an amount too much for the few
feathers you have left to handle.

00:43.910 --> 00:45.370
Hawks.

00:45.960 --> 00:49.850
Right now, you're just an ordinary person.

00:51.730 --> 00:55.500
You were delusional supporting characters

00:55.500 --> 00:59.570
who just happened to be here
with the extremely powerful.

01:00.290 --> 01:05.500
You thought you could face
the demon lord, too?

01:06.520 --> 01:10.070
That you were special?

02:47.450 --> 02:48.980
You...

02:51.370 --> 02:58.730
What you say about fear, strength,
weakness, being special...

03:01.020 --> 03:02.930
I don't care about all that.

03:03.730 --> 03:05.670
I don't care!

03:06.080 --> 03:11.630
It's your fault that my
friends were crying!

03:11.970 --> 03:14.080
Heartbeat Surround...

03:14.080 --> 03:15.930
Legato!

03:17.330 --> 03:20.060
Motivation, behavior, ability...

03:20.060 --> 03:22.820
These are all at the level of someone weak.

03:23.730 --> 03:25.650
It's not enough!

03:25.650 --> 03:28.380
Your power is overwhelmingly lacking!

03:31.600 --> 03:35.190
Is this the will of the Quirks
I've stolen until now?

03:35.560 --> 03:36.750
No way...

03:37.380 --> 03:39.680
Not even New Order was...

03:40.630 --> 03:43.350
Are you saying they got me...

03:44.180 --> 03:47.400
With weakness of the weak?

03:47.910 --> 03:49.420
Hawks!

03:50.660 --> 03:52.000
The first hit...

03:52.610 --> 03:54.510
The second and third hits...

03:55.480 --> 04:00.840
I've hit the same place continuously
to spread the wound.

04:01.350 --> 04:03.340
Bit by bit...

04:04.190 --> 04:06.350
Sound Wave Vibration-Enhanced...

04:08.190 --> 04:10.250
Flight Feather Blade!

04:13.530 --> 04:14.640
Tsukuyomi!

04:14.930 --> 04:17.550
Dark Shadow! This is our chance!

04:18.790 --> 04:21.130
Okay, see you later!

04:23.480 --> 04:28.040
Hawks's current power isn't enough
to inflict a fatal blow...

04:28.690 --> 04:29.770
In that case...

04:33.650 --> 04:35.310
Black Abyss...

04:41.700 --> 04:44.220
Ragnarok: Fleeting Blow!

04:47.840 --> 04:50.660
You thought they were just
stalling for time, didn't you?

04:51.110 --> 04:53.010
But bugs are actually...

04:53.010 --> 04:56.270
pretty annoying!

04:57.400 --> 05:01.060
I needed to dodge the attack just now.

05:01.630 --> 05:04.510
But I realized this too late.

05:06.330 --> 05:09.810
Ever since I lost most of my senses,

05:09.810 --> 05:14.870
I looked for sensory Quirks that could
detect vibrations and infrared radiation.

05:14.870 --> 05:19.630
With those, I'm able to perceive
much more than an ordinary human.

05:20.810 --> 05:26.750
If it was just that girl's immature sound,
it wouldn't have been an obstacle.

05:27.400 --> 05:30.670
The cause was the Quirks' rebelling.

05:30.670 --> 05:32.880
This never happened before.

05:33.880 --> 05:37.430
Does this vulnerability
stem from using copies?

05:37.430 --> 05:41.120
My authority over them is weaker
than when I had the originals!

05:41.930 --> 05:44.680
Until just before this, it was all I could
do to attack when he was unguarded.

05:44.680 --> 05:46.790
I couldn't deliver a fatal blow.

05:47.940 --> 05:50.460
But now, I can kill him in a flash!

05:59.650 --> 06:01.560
You miserable wretches!

06:09.930 --> 06:11.880
Jeez...

06:15.340 --> 06:20.900
That persistence must have warped you...!

06:24.520 --> 06:27.390
Endeavor!

06:35.850 --> 06:37.750
You're even weaker now.

06:38.490 --> 06:40.100
Your position...

06:40.100 --> 06:41.890
atonement...

06:41.890 --> 06:43.530
mistakes...

06:43.530 --> 06:45.090
responsibility...

06:45.560 --> 06:48.810
They've exposed your innate weakness

06:48.810 --> 06:52.120
and lowered you to something I
can't even stand looking at.

06:53.380 --> 06:56.640
You weren't able to become superhuman.

06:58.110 --> 07:00.120
Remember your origin.

07:06.320 --> 07:09.240
Remember what the enemy was.

07:11.830 --> 07:14.810
Remember your father, who tried
to save a girl from evil

07:14.810 --> 07:18.870
and ended up a lump of flesh
along with the girl.

07:21.590 --> 07:25.580
Remember your jealousy and inferiority
complex toward the true superhero.

07:25.590 --> 07:28.090
Hero Registration Form
Enji Todoroki
Endeavor

07:26.390 --> 07:27.790
"Endeavor"...

07:28.700 --> 07:31.630
The name you took on reflected your
effort and subservient nature.

07:32.680 --> 07:36.790
You couldn't keep your ugly heart
together without showing off.

07:38.330 --> 07:39.810
That's right.

07:39.810 --> 07:43.130
You can't be All Might or even Deku.

07:44.920 --> 07:49.320
You only ever fought against
your own weakness.

07:50.850 --> 07:52.060
That's why...

07:53.190 --> 07:56.180
you can't think about being
reborn as someone else.

07:56.180 --> 07:59.110
Keep cursing your own weakness.

07:59.110 --> 08:04.890
That's the only thing that
was keeping you alive!

08:27.700 --> 08:28.940
That's right...

08:29.340 --> 08:31.860
I'm persistent...

08:32.960 --> 08:34.250
That's why,

08:34.250 --> 08:36.430
for the rest of my life,

08:36.430 --> 08:38.050
there will never be a day

08:38.050 --> 08:41.110
where I console myself saying,
"You did a good job."

08:42.070 --> 08:44.570
Ending this fight

08:46.100 --> 08:48.010
is my duty!

08:49.620 --> 08:52.620
That was a close one just now...

08:54.100 --> 08:59.020
Close, huh? I knew that it
would turn out like this...

08:59.690 --> 09:02.440
but I never thought that someone like you

09:02.440 --> 09:06.800
would make me recall the pain of that day.

09:08.690 --> 09:12.590
Wounded heroes are the scariest.

09:18.910 --> 09:20.510
You're too slow.

09:22.810 --> 09:25.120
Vanishing...

09:25.120 --> 09:27.930
Jetburn!

09:31.590 --> 09:33.370
Whoa, that's hot!

09:33.370 --> 09:35.890
Endeavor? That wasn't the plan!

09:35.890 --> 09:37.840
I thought he was going to deliver
the finishing blow up there!

09:37.840 --> 09:40.860
You were supposed to attack
with a Prominence just now!

09:40.860 --> 09:44.230
Didn't you see him switch to
defense at the last minute?

09:48.000 --> 09:50.640
This isn't something I
can do over and over.

09:50.640 --> 09:52.820
I need to physically peel off the defense

09:52.820 --> 09:54.740
and make sure it lands!

09:55.970 --> 09:57.600
You're keeping a cool head.

09:58.030 --> 10:00.240
No, I can't hold back my anger!

10:03.990 --> 10:05.900
All For One...

10:06.770 --> 10:07.960
Everyone, retreat!

10:07.960 --> 10:11.140
Why? Now's our chance to press him!

10:13.080 --> 10:14.830
Do you even have to ask?

10:15.160 --> 10:17.460
Because Endeavor's coming through!

10:31.040 --> 10:34.360
Because of those insects, my mask is...

10:35.250 --> 10:38.180
My body won't move the way I want it to.

10:38.690 --> 10:42.200
But if you're this close...

10:45.150 --> 10:49.540
Your hands destroy people's
futures, you bastard.

10:49.850 --> 10:52.000
You did, too, didn't you?

10:52.000 --> 10:54.220
Yeah, you're right!

10:55.130 --> 10:58.100
My mistakes led to Toya

10:58.560 --> 11:00.830
and stole the futures of many people.

11:03.840 --> 11:06.340
The past won't go away.

11:07.760 --> 11:10.560
The anger, the resentment,
and even the punishment

11:11.360 --> 11:13.730
all come together to create the future.

11:15.430 --> 11:19.560
The future is a path for
the young to walk on.

11:20.230 --> 11:22.260
A path with many choices.

11:24.060 --> 11:25.080
That's why...

11:25.620 --> 11:27.620
I must win.

11:28.890 --> 11:31.630
So that when the young people
walk on that path...

11:31.630 --> 11:34.490
the mistakes adults made in the
past don't block their way.

11:34.490 --> 11:36.910
I'll keep being angry at myself.

11:40.340 --> 11:44.730
The anger, the resentment,
and even the punishment...

11:45.720 --> 11:47.980
I'll keep taking those on myself.

11:49.730 --> 11:52.670
I'll win and keep looking at Toya!

11:53.180 --> 11:54.060
Stop--

11:54.060 --> 11:58.250
Prominence Burn!

12:17.150 --> 12:20.680
We've already confirmed that he
doesn't have super regeneration.

12:20.680 --> 12:23.190
Even if he had a Quirk that
we didn't know about,

12:23.570 --> 12:26.690
without a body like Shigaraki's,

12:27.070 --> 12:28.670
he must be dea--

12:28.670 --> 12:30.620
Get away, Endeavor!

12:32.010 --> 12:34.320
Did you really think I appeared

12:35.020 --> 12:40.040
at the final reckoning with
nothing up my sleeve?

12:41.270 --> 12:47.360
I'm done using this body, and
I'm ready to throw it away.

12:48.120 --> 12:53.280
That's why I can try this...

12:53.830 --> 12:57.790
Did you think that only heroes could
put their lives on the line?

12:59.820 --> 13:04.670
Villains are also scariest when wounded.

13:07.510 --> 13:11.520
Wounded Hero, Burning Bright and True!!

13:16.770 --> 13:19.270
Coffin in the Sky

13:31.890 --> 13:33.280
What's wrong?

13:33.280 --> 13:34.700
Can't do anything but run?

13:37.050 --> 13:38.280
Suneater!

13:43.080 --> 13:44.590
Don't stop!

13:44.590 --> 13:46.050
Stay in motion!

13:46.050 --> 13:48.070
If you stop, you'll be
swallowed up in a second!

13:48.070 --> 13:50.600
Dodge as you aim for the main body!

13:50.960 --> 13:52.720
It's an overwhelming number of arms,

13:52.720 --> 13:57.640
but in exchange, he's given up
his All Might-level mobility.

13:58.920 --> 14:00.160
Ninpo...

14:00.930 --> 14:02.470
Pulp-Thread Throttle!

14:05.630 --> 14:10.310
It's kind of hard to believe that this
is just growth and not a Quirk.

14:10.310 --> 14:14.450
The more All For One's Quirks settle in,

14:14.450 --> 14:19.730
the more my body looks for the best form
to take based on the Quirks stored in me

14:19.730 --> 14:23.280
and various external environmental
considerations.

14:23.640 --> 14:25.410
Shinya Kamihara.

14:26.150 --> 14:28.420
With this body and this power,

14:28.420 --> 14:31.690
everything will be in the palm of my hand.

14:32.980 --> 14:37.220
A world of either me or of what's
outside me will be born.

14:37.600 --> 14:40.250
This world, divided so much in appearance,

14:40.250 --> 14:43.750
form, and ability that
it loses its standard.

14:44.220 --> 14:48.640
Its destination is extinction
and destruction.

14:48.640 --> 14:51.730
When there's too big a disparity,
it breeds misunderstanding.

14:52.090 --> 14:55.480
Misunderstanding breeds fear and rejection.

14:55.480 --> 14:58.380
That result is the world
we live in now, isn't it?

14:58.380 --> 15:00.410
If I take control of it,

15:00.410 --> 15:03.330
then everyone will be equally exploited!

15:03.330 --> 15:06.210
Don't you think that gets
us one step closer

15:06.210 --> 15:09.170
to the peaceful world heroes want?

15:11.370 --> 15:16.460
I don't know if you're Shigaraki
or All For One right now,

15:16.460 --> 15:18.470
but I can't keep listening to you talk.

15:18.470 --> 15:21.310
Ever since Kamino, you've just
be talking and talking.

15:22.830 --> 15:26.020
I've got plenty of sweat stored
up after all that moving.

15:26.470 --> 15:29.740
With what the support course made for me...

15:30.800 --> 15:35.090
Suppressive Heavy Mobile
Unit: Strafe Panzer!

15:35.650 --> 15:39.160
I'll blow some holes right through you!

15:43.810 --> 15:45.710
I'll crush your main body!

15:46.160 --> 15:47.860
We'll all do it together!

15:54.010 --> 15:55.400
So we're a team?

15:57.990 --> 15:59.980
While Monoma and Mr. Aizawa

15:59.980 --> 16:03.850
are sealing off his Quirks with Erasure...

16:04.230 --> 16:09.740
Whoa!

16:04.450 --> 16:06.220
While Kaminari and his group

16:06.220 --> 16:09.730
are powering this arena...

16:10.130 --> 16:11.980
While Yaoyorozu and the others

16:11.980 --> 16:14.930
keep giving us a place to stand...

16:16.880 --> 16:20.260
Misunderstanding breeds fear and rejection.

16:23.530 --> 16:27.790
You looked like you were asking for help...

16:28.680 --> 16:31.130
The disparity that's too great...

16:32.380 --> 16:37.340
Don't say that you're okay losing!

16:38.030 --> 16:39.690
and misunderstanding...

16:40.420 --> 16:41.720
Why was I...

16:43.220 --> 16:46.490
Why was I the one who ended All Might?!

16:47.160 --> 16:48.810
and fear...

16:50.620 --> 16:52.160
I'm sorry for everything.

16:53.260 --> 16:56.430
I took all that in a long time ago!

16:57.640 --> 16:58.740
Bakugo!

16:59.060 --> 17:04.960
And I've seen it all take a step forward.

17:05.450 --> 17:09.560
I know that there are those who
are trying to move forward

17:09.560 --> 17:11.270
even if it takes time.

17:11.270 --> 17:15.510
So I don't need you to meddle,
you nutsack-faced handyman!

17:15.510 --> 17:19.090
Great Explosion Murder God... Dynamight!

17:21.750 --> 17:25.660
Howitzer Impact...

17:26.130 --> 17:29.190
Cluster!

17:31.610 --> 17:33.940
Katsuki Bakugo

17:39.070 --> 17:42.080
The fuse on engine number 6 is
blown. We need a replacement now!

17:42.080 --> 17:43.670
The shaft is warping!

17:43.670 --> 17:46.000
We need a spare over here, quickly!

17:46.650 --> 17:49.510
We're losing altitude! We're going to crash!

17:49.510 --> 17:52.700
Apparently, Shigaraki's gotten
huge! He's too heavy!

17:53.040 --> 17:55.670
The messenger-guard is going up top, too!

17:55.670 --> 17:57.460
Increase your output!

17:58.300 --> 18:01.230
We're here at U.A. High School in the Sky.

18:01.830 --> 18:05.820
Because of the electromagnetic
barrier put up to trap Shigaraki,

18:05.820 --> 18:08.230
those inside cannot communicate
with the outside world.

18:08.670 --> 18:10.670
Stop filming and start working!

18:10.670 --> 18:13.680
Wait, why are business
course students here?!

18:13.680 --> 18:17.810
Mandalay's Telepath is their only
connection to the outside world.

18:17.810 --> 18:20.080
That's right, this is a coffin,

18:20.080 --> 18:23.440
and we are all joining Shigaraki
on his journey into death--

18:23.440 --> 18:25.770
Oh no, you're filming a documentary!

18:25.770 --> 18:27.410
That's not what we need right now!

18:27.540 --> 18:28.330
Wham

18:28.400 --> 18:29.340
Yes, it is!

18:29.340 --> 18:31.420
No, it isn't! Not right now!

18:31.420 --> 18:36.030
Then! What about the videos and
pictures of historical fights?

18:36.030 --> 18:39.390
Who do you think preserved
those, and for what purpose?

18:40.660 --> 18:45.490
The job of us in the business
course is to promote the heroes--

18:45.490 --> 18:49.370
Consequently, we have been taught
how to connect heroes to society.

18:49.790 --> 18:53.850
We will record this along with all that we
have learned in the past three years here.

18:54.350 --> 18:59.370
How they... no, how WE won.

19:02.170 --> 19:04.990
Howitzer Impact...

19:04.990 --> 19:07.350
Cluster!

19:19.340 --> 19:21.640
Monoma! Don't close your eyes!

19:23.100 --> 19:25.480
This thunderous rumbling and shaking is...

19:25.480 --> 19:27.400
It must be Bakugo!

19:27.840 --> 19:31.680
Hey, hey, hey! The barrier's utility
poles aren't broken, are they?

19:32.140 --> 19:35.100
Hey, is that Bakugo kid okay?

19:35.380 --> 19:37.410
Is he thinking about where he is?

19:37.410 --> 19:41.460
What if Nejire's beautiful hair
burns again and gets even shorter?

19:41.460 --> 19:43.910
Don't worry, Haya!

19:44.180 --> 19:46.740
Despite how he looks, he actually
pays a lot of attention to detail!

19:46.740 --> 19:51.280
When we're eating, he's always telling
me to keep my left hand on the table!

19:51.280 --> 19:53.240
Does that have anything to do with this?!

19:54.270 --> 19:55.500
What I mean is,

19:55.940 --> 20:00.660
he's not someone who would fight without
thinking about what's around him.

20:02.810 --> 20:07.900
You condense your explosions so
you don't hit those around you,

20:07.900 --> 20:10.760
and that raises their power
to a different level.

20:11.150 --> 20:13.890
It's wonderful... that's why...

20:15.210 --> 20:16.580
I broke it.

20:21.240 --> 20:26.170
Sorry, but I'm still not interested

20:26.170 --> 20:29.350
in your path or your growth.

20:30.600 --> 20:31.710
Dynamight!

20:33.780 --> 20:37.560
Shigaraki...!

20:37.840 --> 20:42.420
Hey, who's the one who said,

20:42.420 --> 20:45.090
"If we could just get
close to his main body"?

20:45.720 --> 20:48.680
Getting close to me means

20:49.720 --> 20:56.190
you'll have to experience power the level
of All Might's with that body of yours.

21:07.170 --> 21:10.770
That was my biggest attack...

21:13.380 --> 21:16.640
Is he really that far away from me?

21:18.260 --> 21:21.660
What are you thinking?
What are you aiming for?

21:22.010 --> 21:24.010
Katsuki Bakugo.

21:25.090 --> 21:29.370
If there's just one thing I'm
interested in about you...

21:30.420 --> 21:35.440
it's that you're the person closest
to Izuku Midoriya right now...

21:36.320 --> 21:40.550
In that case, he'll definitely
come back here.

21:41.890 --> 21:44.270
Izuku Midoriya...

21:45.540 --> 21:48.010
and One For All...

23:19.960 --> 23:21.960
Preview

23:21.190 --> 23:22.620
Here's the preview.

23:23.250 --> 23:27.910
Even the Cluster Kacchan fired with
his all didn't work on Shigaraki.

23:28.660 --> 23:30.990
Kacchan's backed into a corner.

23:31.970 --> 23:33.300
But still...

23:33.750 --> 23:35.630
Even still...

23:37.020 --> 23:39.800
Next time, "Light Fades to Rain."

23:40.380 --> 23:45.940
In the midst of that, the pride of U.A.,
the Big Three, finally take a stand.

23:46.600 --> 23:48.070
Go beyond!

23:48.070 --> 23:49.530
Plus Ultra!
